    "https://jobs.tcu.edu/jobs/search/faculty-jobs": {
      "title": "Faculty Jobs",
      "description": "Faculty Jobs Home Faculty TCU Faculty Experience View Faculty Opportunities Staff TCU Staff Experience View Staff Opportunities Why TCU? View All Jobs APPLICANT LOGIN Kiosk mode Faculty Jobs Skip to jobs search results Category Search categories 2 filter options found Category Adjunct Faculty (74 items) 74 Faculty (9 items) 9 Employment Type Search employment types 3 filter options found Employment Type Full-time (9 items) 9 Part-time (2 items) 2 Temporary (72 items) 72 College/Unit Search 8 filter options found College/Unit AddRan College (18 items) 18 College of Education (7 items) 7 College of Fine Arts (10 items) 10 College of Science & Engineering (16 items) 16 Harris College of Nursing & Health Sciences (12 items) 12 John V. Roach Honors College (1 items) 1 M.J. Neeley School of Business (13 items) 13 Schieffer College of Communication (6 items) 6 Search by job title, location, department, category, etc. Search Instructor, Instructor II or Senior Instructor of Analytics/Statistics 501254 TCU Main Campus Faculty Full-time M.J. Neeley School of Business This full-time faculty position is on-campus and in-person. Texas Christian University invites applications for the non-tenure track position of Instructor of Analytics/Statistics in the Department of Information Systems and Supply Chain Management (INSC) in the Neeley School of Business beginning August 2027. We are looking for a colleague with a rich background in the following areas: Analytics, Artificial Intelligence /Machine Learning, Information Systems, Statistics. Read more Assistant or Associate Professor of Psychology 501242 TCU Main Campus Faculty Full-time College of Science & Engineering HEALTH PSYCHOLOGY FACULTY POSITION AVAILABLE\n\nThis full-time faculty position is on-campus and in-person. The TCU Department of Psychology is hiring a tenure-track Assistant or Associate Professor beginning August 2027. This position is part of a broader strategic initiative to build a nationally recognized research program focused on health and well-being. Primary consideration will be given to candidates who have completed a Ph.D. in any area of Psychology. We are particularly interested in health psychology research focused on addiction science, digital technologies and artificial intelligence (AI), intervention/implementation science, aging, behavioral science/medicine, or biomedical approaches, but we welcome applications from all areas of psychology. Application Deadline: 10/1/2026 Read more Director of the Institute of Ranch Management and Associate Professor of Professional Practice in Ranch Management 501241 TCU Main Campus Faculty Full-time College of Science & Engineering The TCU Ranch Management Program invites applications for the William Watt Matthews Director of the Institute of Ranch Management and Associate Professor of Professional Practice in Ranch Management, a leadership position at one of the nation's premier ranch management programs. The Director will shape industry partnerships, advance applied agricultural education, and prepare the next generation of ranch and agricultural business leaders. The Ranch Management Institute's primary function is to establish industry partnerships and conduct educational outreach for the TCU Ranch Management program. Read more Assistant/Associate Professor or Assistant/Associate Professor of Professional Practice - Occupational Therapy 500889 TCU Main Campus Faculty Full-time Harris College of Nursing & Health Sciences The Harris College of Nursing & Health Sciences invites applications for one 12-month faculty position as a Tenure-Track Assistant/Associate Professor or Assistant/Associate Professor of Professional Practice (non-tenure) for the developing entry-level Doctor of Occupational Therapy (OTD) Program at Texas Christian University (TCU). Read more Assistant, Associate, or Full Professor of Chemistry 501167 TCU Main Campus Faculty Full-time College of Science & Engineering This full-time faculty position is on-campus and in-person. \n\nThe Department of Chemistry & Biochemistry is conducting an open search for a tenure-track or tenured position in chemistry or aligned fields adopting a molecular perspective. While candidates from any subdiscipline are encouraged to apply, emphasis will be placed on individuals with backgrounds in inorganic or bioinorganic chemistry. Read more Assistant or Associate Professor of Social Work 501095 TCU Main Campus Faculty Full-time Harris College of Nursing & Health Sciences This full-time faculty position is on-campus and in-person. \n\nThe Department of Social Work at Texas Christian University seeks new scholars to help build on the Department of Social Work’s history of success in our thriving BSW and MSW programs, and who are willing to contribute to interdisciplinary, interprofessional, and community-engaged teaching, scholarship, research, and service. We are seeking to fill a tenure-track faculty position – at the Assistant or Associate Professor level. Read more Assistant Professor of Management 501150 TCU Main Campus Faculty Full-time M.J. Neeley School of Business This full-time faculty position is on-campus and in-person. \n\nThe Department of Management and Leadership at Texas Christian University invites applications for an assistant professor tenure-track position in Strategic Management within the Neeley School of Business. Successful candidates will begin employment in Fall 2027. Read more Assistant Professor of Accounting 501050 TCU Main Campus Faculty Full-time M.J. Neeley School of Business The Department of Accounting at Texas Christian University invites applications for an Assistant Professor of Accounting in the Neeley School of Business for Fall 2027. Read more Physician Associate Faculty Adjunct Pool 501118 TCU Main Campus Adjunct Faculty Part-time Harris College of Nursing & Health Sciences The Physician Associate Program in the Harris College of Nursing & Health Sciences occasionally has openings for part-time temporary adjunct instructors. Applying for a part-time teaching appointment in the Physician Associate Program would add the applicant to a pool which is available to the departmental search committee for consideration in case the need arises. Read more Professional Aviation Faculty Adjunct Pool 501021 TCU Main Campus Adjunct Faculty Temporary College of Education This part-time faculty position is on a semester-by-semester basis and is not eligible for benefits.\nThe College of Education at Texas Christian University invites applications for an adjunct faculty pool to support instructional needs in the B.S. in Professional Aviation program. Read more Visiting Lecturer-English 500205 TCU Main Campus Faculty Full-time AddRan College The English Department of Texas Christian University invites applicants for full-time Visiting Lecturer positions for on-campus, in-person teaching. This is one-year, full-time, non-renewable position. The teaching load is 4 courses per semester, primarily in composition, but also possibly in literature, creative writing, or any combination of the three.  We invite applicants to demonstrate in their application materials how they might contribute to the department's core mission of providing a socially just literacy education. Read more Health Sciences & Public Health Faculty Adjunct Pool 499518 TCU Main Campus Adjunct Faculty Temporary Harris College of Nursing & Health Sciences The Department of Health Sciences & Public Health occasionally has openings for part-time temporary adjunct instructors to teach courses outside of the academic departments within Harris College. Read more Fashion Merchandising Faculty Adjunct Pool 499437 TCU Main Campus Adjunct Faculty Temporary College of Fine Arts The Department of Fashion Merchandising in the College of Fine Arts occasionally has openings for part-time temporary adjunct instructors. Read more Journalism Faculty Adjunct Pool 499423 TCU Main Campus Adjunct Faculty Temporary Schieffer College of Communication The Department of Journalism in the Bob Schieffer College of Communication occasionally has openings for part-time temporary adjunct instructors. Read more Communication Studies Faculty Adjunct Pool 499421 TCU Main Campus Adjunct Faculty Temporary Schieffer College of Communication The Department of Communication Studies in the Bob Schieffer College of Communication occasionally has openings for part-time temporary adjunct instructors. Read more Film, TV, & Digital Media Faculty Adjunct Pool 499422 TCU Main Campus Adjunct Faculty Temporary Schieffer College of Communication The Department of Film, TV & Digital Media in the Bob Schieffer College of Communication occasionally has openings for part-time temporary adjunct instructors. Read more Women and Gender Studies Faculty Adjunct Pool 499419 TCU Main Campus Adjunct Faculty Temporary AddRan College The Department of Women and Gender Studies (WGST) in the AddRan College of Liberal Arts occasionally has openings for part-time, temporary adjunct instructors. Read more Strategic Communication Faculty Adjunct Pool 499425 TCU Main Campus Adjunct Faculty Temporary Schieffer College of Communication The Department of Strategic Communication in the Bob Schieffer College of Communication occasionally has openings for part-time temporary adjunct instructors. Read more Anthropology Faculty Adjunct Pool 499417 TCU Main Campus Adjunct Faculty Temporary AddRan College The Department of Anthropology in the AddRan College of Liberal Arts occasionally has openings for part-time temporary adjunct instructors. Read more Master of Liberal Arts Faculty Adjunct Pool 499420 TCU Main Campus Adjunct Faculty Temporary AddRan College The Master of Liberal Arts program has occasional openings each semester for adjunct/overload faculty to teach graduate level courses in this multidisciplinary studies program. Read more Health Communication & Media Minor Faculty Adjunct Pool 499424 TCU Main Campus Adjunct Faculty Temporary Schieffer College of Communication The Bob Schieffer College of Communication occasionally has openings for part-time temporary adjunct instructors to teach in our health, communication & media minor. Read more Spanish & Hispanic Studies Adjunct Pool 499418 TCU Main Campus Adjunct Faculty Temporary AddRan College The Department of Spanish & Hispanic Studies in the AddRan College of Liberal Arts occasionally has openings for part-time adjunct instructors. Read more College of Education Adjunct Pool - Counseling 499426 TCU Main Campus Adjunct Faculty Temporary College of Education The College of Education occasionally has openings for part-time temporary adjunct instructors with specializations in counseling. Read more Entrepreneurship and Innovation Juris Doctor Adjunct Pool 499463 TCU Main Campus Adjunct Faculty Temporary M.J. Neeley School of Business The Department of Entrepreneurship in the Neeley School of Business occasionally has openings for part-time temporary adjunct Juris Doctor instructors to lead sections of a transactional and entrepreneurial focused business law course. Read more Social Work Faculty Adjunct Pool 499458 TCU Main Campus Adjunct Faculty Temporary Harris College of Nursing & Health Sciences The Department of Social Work in the Harris College of Nursing and Health Sciences occasionally has openings for part-time temporary adjunct instructors. Read more Supply Chain Management Faculty Adjunct Pool 499467 TCU Main Campus Adjunct Faculty Temporary M.J. Neeley School of Business The Department of Supply Chain Management in the Neeley School of Business occasionally has openings for part-time temporary adjunct instructors. Read more Honors College Adjunct Pool 499460 TCU Main Campus Adjunct Faculty Temporary John V. Roach Honors College The John V. Roach Honors College occasionally has openings for part-time temporary adjunct instructors. Read more Sociology Faculty Adjunct Pool 499416 TCU Main Campus Adjunct Faculty Temporary AddRan College The Department of Sociology in the AddRan College of Liberal Arts occasionally has openings for part-time temporary adjunct instructors. Read more Marketing Faculty Adjunct Pool 499469 TCU Main Campus Adjunct Faculty Temporary M.J. Neeley School of Business The Department of Marketing in the Neeley School of Business occasionally has openings for part-time temporary adjunct instructors. Read more Modern Languages Faculty Adjunct Pool 499413 TCU Main Campus Adjunct Faculty Temporary AddRan College The Department of Modern Language Studies in the AddRan College of Liberal Arts occasionally has openings for part-time, temporary adjunct instructors in French, Italian, German, Arabic, Chinese, and Japanese. Read more Displaying 1 - 30 of 83 in total ‹ 1 2 3 › Human Resources 2701 W. Berry Street Fort Worth, Texas 76109 Phone: 817-257-7790 TCU Box 298200 Fort Worth, Texas 76129 Quick Links Home Faculty Jobs Staff Jobs Other Opportunities Why TCU? Applicant Login Work at TCU Accessibility Notice of Nondiscrimination Title IX Legal Disclosures Privacy Accreditation All content © 2023 Texas Christian University . All rights reserved. Top Candidate Details TCU uses \"cookies\" (i.e., a small text file that is sent to your browser from the Site) to improve your return access and visits to the Site. TCU may use cookies to customize content, to analyze Site activity and user behavior, including, without limitation, through Google Analytics Demographics and Interest Reporting, and for advertising and promotional purposes (further discussed in \"Interest-based Advertising\" below). TCU reserves the right to use cookies in the future in conjunction with new or extended functionalities. Privacy Policy I do not accept I accept"
