n adjunct faculty pool to support instructional needs in the B.S. in Professional Aviation program. Read more Health Sciences & Public Health Faculty Adjunct Pool 499518 TCU Main Campus Adjunct Faculty Temporary Harris College of Nursing & Health Sciences The Department of Health Sciences & Public Health occasionally has openings for part-time temporary adjunct instructors to teach courses outside of the academic departments within Harris College. Read more Member Services Assistant 500947 TCU Main Campus Professional Staff Temporary Temporary Campus Life The Member Services position is responsible for providing customer service to participants so that they may have the utmost quality experience while using the Recreation Center. Read more Police Officer-Temporary 500852 TCU Main Campus Police / Campus Security Temporary Temporary Student Affairs The Police Officer is responsible for providing security services by preventing crime; enforcing laws; apprehending suspects; monitoring traffic. Read more Fashion Merchandising Faculty Adjunct Pool 499437 TCU Main Campus Adjunct Faculty Temporary College of Fine Arts The Department of Fashion Merchandising in the College of Fine Arts occasionally has openings for part-time temporary adjunct instructors. Read more Journalism Faculty Adjunct Pool 499423 TCU Main Campus Adjunct Faculty Temporary Schieffer College of Communication The Department of Journalism in the Bob Schieffer College of Communication occasionally has openings for part-time temporary adjunct instructors. Read more Communication Studies Faculty Adjunct Pool 499421 TCU Main Campus Adjunct Faculty Temporary Schieffer College of Communication The Department of Communication Studies in the Bob Schieffer College of Communication occasionally has openings for part-time temporary adjunct instructors. Read more Film, TV, & Digital Media Faculty Adjunct Pool 499422 TCU Main Campus Adjunct Faculty Temporary Schieffer College of Communication The Department of Film, TV